Package: direct-rdp
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: gnome-keyring
Description: simple RDP and VNC client for your own computers
 Direct RDP & VNC connects to Windows PCs, GNOME Remote Desktop and xrdp
 over RDP, and to Macs and other VNC servers over VNC. Type the address,
 sign in, and you're in: no account, no relay server, nothing to install
 on the other computer.
 .
 The remote desktop resizes to fit the window, passwords are kept in the
 system keyring, and Wake on LAN, Ctrl+Alt+Del and full screen are built in.
